# Vertigo-style town: stepping into a doorway opens that building. The well in the
# middle is a landmark; the stairs in the south-east corner lead down to the dungeon.

event 3,3 any
  npc smith "Steel for the brave, at fair prices. Have a look."
  town smith

event 9,3 any
  npc innkeeper "Sit down, sit down! Food, drink and the latest gossip."
  town tavern

event 15,3 any
  npc priest "Peace, travellers. The temple heals the wounded and lifts curses, for an offering."
  town temple

event 21,3 any
  npc guildmage "The guild teaches those who can pay for wisdom."
  town guild

event 3,8 any
  npc trainer "Experience means nothing without practice. Ready to train?"
  town trainer

event 9,8 any
  npc banker "Your gold is safe with us. Mostly."
  town bank

event 17,8 any
  npc innkeeper "A bed for the night? The sheets are almost clean."
  town inn

event 12,6 s
  text sign "The town well." "Stairs to the dungeon are in the south-east corner."

event 23,10 any
  text "Worn stone steps lead down into the dark."

event 23,10 any use
  sound stairs
  teleport demo 2 1
